##   1.2   --- Drop sounds
###  1.2.1 ----- All items
Show
    DisableDropSound
    Continue
##   1.3   --- Text
###  1.3.1 ----- Normal Rarity
Show
Rarity Normal
    SetTextColor 200 200 200 255 # game client color
    Continue
###  1.3.2 ----- Magic Rarity
Show
Rarity Magic
    SetTextColor 136 136 255 255 # game client color
    Continue
###  1.3.3 ----- Rare Rarity
Show
Rarity Rare
    SetTextColor 255 255 119 255 # game client color
    Continue
###  1.3.4 ----- Unique Rarity
Show
Rarity Unique
    SetTextColor 175 96 37 255 # game client color
    Continue
###  1.3.5 ----- Gems
Show
Class "Gems"
    SetTextColor 15 145 140 255
    Continue
###  1.3.6 ----- Fractured
Show
FracturedItem True
    SetTextColor 165 150 100 255
    Continue
###  1.3.7 ----- Synthesised
Show
SynthesisedItem True
    SetTextColor 165 150 100 255
    Continue
###  1.3.8 ----- Influenced
Show
HasInfluence Shaper Elder Crusader Hunter Redeemer Warlord
    SetTextColor 165 150 100 255
    Continue
###  1.3.9 ----- Corrupted
Show
Corrupted True
    SetTextColor  210 0 0 255
    Continue
###  1.3.10----- Crafted
Show
Identified True
HasExplicitMod "Veil" "Chosen" "Order" "Craft" "Upgraded" "Subterranean" "Underground"
    SetTextColor 184 218 242 255
    Continue
